[
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ2V0X4K7M9D1S6P3R8N5C",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 0,
    "start_ms": 0,
    "duration_ms": 4120,
    "end_ms": 4120,
    "text": "Today we're going to build a tiny Rust CLI that calls the GitHub API.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:12:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:12:41Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ34H7D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 1,
    "start_ms": 4120,
    "duration_ms": 5360,
    "end_ms": 9480,
    "text": "We'll start with clap for args, then reqwest for HTTP, and serde to parse JSON.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:13:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:13:09Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ3B1P9D0M6C2V7Q8R5N3A",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 2,
    "start_ms": 9480,
    "duration_ms": 4630,
    "end_ms": 14110,
    "text": "If you want to follow along, the repo link is in the description.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:13:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:14:06Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ3K2T5R9D0S6N1C7V4B3Q",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 3,
    "start_ms": 14110,
    "duration_ms": 5170,
    "end_ms": 19280,
    "text": "First, generate a token and export it as GITHUB_TOKEN to avoid rate limits.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:14:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:14:21Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ3N6C1K8Q4V0D7M2S5P9R",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 4,
    "start_ms": 19280,
    "duration_ms": 6020,
    "end_ms": 25300,
    "text": "We'll hit /repos/{owner}/{repo} and print stars, forks, and open issues.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:15:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:15:03Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ41Q4D7N2M9S0V5K8C3R6",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ2H6G2P7F1K9S4N8D3Q5M",
    "seq": 5,
    "start_ms": 25300,
    "duration_ms": 4010,
    "end_ms": 29310,
    "text": "Finally we'll add basic retries and a friendly error message on 403s.",
    "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:15:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-03T09:16:12Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4B7N4Q1D6S9K0V3M8C2R5",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ5C7Q1S9K4D0H2M8V6P3R",
    "seq": 0,
    "start_ms": 0,
    "duration_ms": 3890,
    "end_ms": 3890,
    "text": "In this video, we'll demystify attention by coding a minimal transformer block.",
    "created_at": "2026-02-12T18:27:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T18:27:14Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4H8B2V6P1M9D4Q0K5R7C",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ5C7Q1S9K4D0H2M8V6P3R",
    "seq": 1,
    "start_ms": 3890,
    "duration_ms": 5740,
    "end_ms": 9630,
    "text": "We'll use PyTorch, keep shapes explicit, and verify outputs with a tiny test.",
    "created_at": "2026-02-12T18:27:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T18:28:05Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4K9P4S7D1Q6M0V8R2C5N",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ5C7Q1S9K4D0H2M8V6P3R",
    "seq": 2,
    "start_ms": 9630,
    "duration_ms": 4980,
    "end_ms": 14610,
    "text": "The key idea is dot-product similarity, scaled, then softmaxed over the keys.",
    "created_at": "2026-02-12T18:28:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T18:28:33Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4M9K7V2R0D6Q1H8B5T4C",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ5C7Q1S9K4D0H2M8V6P3R",
    "seq": 3,
    "start_ms": 14610,
    "duration_ms": 5410,
    "end_ms": 20020,
    "text": "We'll also show how masking works for causal attention in language models.",
    "created_at": "2026-02-12T18:29:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T18:29:16Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4Q6N1C7V4B3Q8R5N3A0D",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ7H8B2V6P1M9D4Q0K5R7C",
    "seq": 0,
    "start_ms": 0,
    "duration_ms": 4330,
    "end_ms": 4330,
    "text": "Alright, quick tour of the new Notion calendar integration and how I plan weeks.",
    "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:48:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T07:48:03Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4S1P6D4Q9K0M2V7R5C8N",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ7H8B2V6P1M9D4Q0K5R7C",
    "seq": 1,
    "start_ms": 4330,
    "duration_ms": 6120,
    "end_ms": 10450,
    "text": "I keep tasks in a database view, then drag time blocks onto the calendar.",
    "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:48:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T07:48:37Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4V2K9C0R7D1M8S4Q6N5B",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ7H8B2V6P1M9D4Q0K5R7C",
    "seq": 2,
    "start_ms": 10450,
    "duration_ms": 4770,
    "end_ms": 15220,
    "text": "For deep work, I add a 'no meetings' tag and review it in the daily template.",
    "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:49:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T07:49:54Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ4X3N8C5Q2R7D1K9M4S0V",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJ7H8B2V6P1M9D4Q0K5R7C",
    "seq": 3,
    "start_ms": 15220,
    "duration_ms": 5580,
    "end_ms": 20800,
    "text": "If you share a workspace, permissions matter—don't expose personal notes by default.",
    "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:50:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-21T07:50:11Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ50D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N1",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJBE4D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N",
    "seq": 0,
    "start_ms": 0,
    "duration_ms": 4680,
    "end_ms": 4680,
    "text": "Welcome back—today we're troubleshooting flaky CI on GitHub Actions.",
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T22:16:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T22:16:28Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ52R9D4K8V1M5S7Q0N6C",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJBE4D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N",
    "seq": 1,
    "start_ms": 4680,
    "duration_ms": 5930,
    "end_ms": 10610,
    "text": "We'll add a cache key, pin action versions, and print environment diagnostics.",
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T22:17:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T22:17:33Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ55K3V1D8Q0M5S9R2C6N",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJBE4D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N",
    "seq": 2,
    "start_ms": 10610,
    "duration_ms": 5190,
    "end_ms": 15800,
    "text": "If a job fails once but passes on rerun, it's usually network or an unpinned toolchain.",
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T22:18:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T22:18:09Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "yts_01J8ZQ57D4K9M0Q2V6R8N3C1S",
    "track_id": "ytt_01J6ZJBE4D2Q9S6K1M8V0R5C7N",
    "seq": 3,
    "start_ms": 15800,
    "duration_ms": 6070,
    "end_ms": 21870,
    "text": "Last tip: set concurrency and cancel-in-progress to avoid duplicate deploys.",
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T22:18:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T22:19:21Z"
  }
]